# Visual identity

Read `docs/visual-identity.md` before changing sector UI, charts, or brand tokens.

## Rules

- Source of truth: `web/src/brand/` + `web/src/brand/brand.css` (`.bo` tokens).
- Personality: **Instrument** (charts, KPIs, filters, source disclosure) + **Imprint** (hero/threshold only).
- Never put stamps, ASCII fields, or halftone textures inside a chart plot.
- Data chooses the form (line / bars / stacked share) — do not default everything to a line.
- Geography once per module; condense source to publisher + disclosure.
- Sector pigment (`--bo-sector`) is imprint-only, never series colour.
- Do not fork a second design system for Energy/Economy/etc. Wrap pages in `BrandRoot`.
- Changing identity requires updating `docs/visual-identity.md` and `brand.css` together.

Craft refs: Hermes/Nous, Content Architecture, every.to. Product north star: Notion British Exchange page.
